   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="HelpLabel">
     <property name="visible"><bool>false</bool></property>
     <property name="text"><string>Time is in seconds. In a legacy formula, initialValue uses the joint's current angle or distance at generation. In the profile editor, initialValue uses the explicit position at profile start; it is not reevaluated from the joint on each run.

Linear: C + VEL*time
Quadratic: C + VEL*time + 0.5*ACC*time^2
Harmonic: C + AMP*sin(VEL*time - PHASE)
Exponential: C*exp(time/TIMEC)</string></property>
